Available framework skills:

| Category | Skills                                                                                                                                                      |
| -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `mcp`    | `mcp_setup-mcp-server`, `mcp_update-mcp-servers`, `mcp_fix-docker-perms`, `mcp_generate-mcp-configs`, `mcp_check-mcp-servers`, `mcp_start-http-mcp-servers` |
